{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Breed unique rabbits powered by real genetics. Grow your cozy farm, take on quests, and discover ultra-rare coats\u2014at your own pace, round by round.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966790/extras/71fa9626c0fd7ebab3c20cad40fcb2ad.poster.avif?t=1773858958\" width=1024 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966790/extras/71fa9626c0fd7ebab3c20cad40fcb2ad.webm?t=1773858958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966790/extras/71fa9626c0fd7ebab3c20cad40fcb2ad.mp4?t=1773858958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rare Rabbits \u2013 Snuggle Haven is an adorable, turn-based simulation game where you can already breed more than <strong>6,000,000 unique rabbits</strong> and manage your very own rabbit farm. <strong>Each rabbit\u2019s appearance and traits are determined by scientifically accurate genetics and inheritance principles, down to the smallest allele!</strong><br>Take good care of your long-eared friends, play mini-games with them, and build dreamy hutches and homes for your rabbits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966790/extras/44b14eeaeed6425ab04393fabd7b14e3.poster.avif?t=1773858958\" width=1024 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966790/extras/44b14eeaeed6425ab04393fabd7b14e3.webm?t=1773858958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966790/extras/44b14eeaeed6425ab04393fabd7b14e3.mp4?t=1773858958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover <strong>over 6 million rabbit variations</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breeding is based on <strong>real genetics</strong>, down to the allele level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breed at your own pace \u2013 no stress, just pure discovery, round by round</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow your curiosity \u2013 take on quests for inspiration or breed freely as you wish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet quirky customers \u2013 from a <strong>hedgehog wizard</strong> to the mysterious vixen <strong>Alice</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dance, race, and play with your rabbits in <strong>fun little mini-games</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell your rarest rabbits to afford <strong>new upgrades and homes</strong>, or let your favorite bunnies stay with you forever in Snuggle Haven</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Scientific Basis</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While playing <strong>Rare Rabbits - Snuggle Haven</strong>, you\u2019ll learn about the <strong>principles of genetics</strong> in a playful way (dominant-recessive inheritance, co-dominant traits, etc.).<br>To create specific fur colors and coat patterns, you\u2019ll need to study the <strong>family trees</strong> and rare <strong>alleles</strong> of your rabbits carefully and choose the best breeding pairs accordingly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966790/extras/33cdc443086aa21de368e0c324141a73.avif?t=1773858958\" width=1024 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Feeding, Upgrading and Building</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your rabbits need more than just love \u2013 they also need <strong>good food</strong> and a <strong>cozy home</strong>. With the money you earn from selling your rabbits, you can <strong>buy different houses</strong>, <strong>upgrade them</strong>, and even <strong>expand your meadow</strong>!<br>But be prepared\u2026 winter is coming \u2013 are you ready?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966790/extras/2dc83e20caf992d0d906164ebf116f7e.poster.avif?t=1773858958\" width=1024 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966790/extras/2dc83e20caf992d0d906164ebf116f7e.webm?t=1773858958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966790/extras/2dc83e20caf992d0d906164ebf116f7e.mp4?t=1773858958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Relaxed Exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover <strong>ultra-rare alleles</strong> across <strong>eight rarity levels</strong> in your bred rabbits, and learn more about the <strong>real principles of inheritance</strong> through the in-game book.<br>With the <strong>\u201c1 month = 1 game round\u201d</strong> system, you decide how much time you want to spend with your rabbits each month.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to <strong>breed the rarest rabbits</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966790/extras/d18dec0112f5cc32c419cf6c39325e99.poster.avif?t=1773858958\" width=1024 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966790/extras/d18dec0112f5cc32c419cf6c39325e99.webm?t=1773858958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966790/extras/d18dec0112f5cc32c419cf6c39325e99.mp4?t=1773858958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3966790?t=1773858958","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966790/cfabf0523c622e1046003e00d7ef750760717a8c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773858958","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966790/2a0461b68478c3418659ffd737e57bc2f6fb438d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773858958","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966790/2a0461b68478c3418659ffd737e57bc2f6fb438d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773858958","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Breed unique rabbits powered by real genetics. Grow your cozy farm, take on quests, and discover ultra-rare coats\u2014at your own pace, round by round.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966790/extras/71fa9626c0fd7ebab3c20cad40fcb2ad.poster.avif?t=1773858958\" width=1024 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966790/extras/71fa9626c0fd7ebab3c20cad40fcb2ad.webm?t=1773858958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966790/extras/71fa9626c0fd7ebab3c20cad40fcb2ad.mp4?t=1773858958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rare Rabbits \u2013 Snuggle Haven is an adorable, turn-based simulation game where you can already breed more than <strong>6,000,000 unique rabbits</strong> and manage your very own rabbit farm. <strong>Each rabbit\u2019s appearance and traits are determined by scientifically accurate genetics and inheritance principles, down to the smallest allele!</strong><br>Take good care of your long-eared friends, play mini-games with them, and build dreamy hutches and homes for your rabbits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966790/extras/44b14eeaeed6425ab04393fabd7b14e3.poster.avif?t=1773858958\" width=1024 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966790/extras/44b14eeaeed6425ab04393fabd7b14e3.webm?t=1773858958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966790/extras/44b14eeaeed6425ab04393fabd7b14e3.mp4?t=1773858958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover <strong>over 6 million rabbit variations</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breeding is based on <strong>real genetics</strong>, down to the allele level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breed at your own pace \u2013 no stress, just pure discovery, round by round</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow your curiosity \u2013 take on quests for inspiration or breed freely as you wish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet quirky customers \u2013 from a <strong>hedgehog wizard</strong> to the mysterious vixen <strong>Alice</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dance, race, and play with your rabbits in <strong>fun little mini-games</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell your rarest rabbits to afford <strong>new upgrades and homes</strong>, or let your favorite bunnies stay with you forever in Snuggle Haven</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Scientific Basis</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While playing <strong>Rare Rabbits - Snuggle Haven</strong>, you\u2019ll learn about the <strong>principles of genetics</strong> in a playful way (dominant-recessive inheritance, co-dominant traits, etc.).<br>To create specific fur colors and coat patterns, you\u2019ll need to study the <strong>family trees</strong> and rare <strong>alleles</strong> of your rabbits carefully and choose the best breeding pairs accordingly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966790/extras/33cdc443086aa21de368e0c324141a73.avif?t=1773858958\" width=1024 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Feeding, Upgrading and Building</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your rabbits need more than just love \u2013 they also need <strong>good food</strong> and a <strong>cozy home</strong>. With the money you earn from selling your rabbits, you can <strong>buy different houses</strong>, <strong>upgrade them</strong>, and even <strong>expand your meadow</strong>!<br>But be prepared\u2026 winter is coming \u2013 are you ready?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966790/extras/2dc83e20caf992d0d906164ebf116f7e.poster.avif?t=1773858958\" width=1024 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966790/extras/2dc83e20caf992d0d906164ebf116f7e.webm?t=1773858958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966790/extras/2dc83e20caf992d0d906164ebf116f7e.mp4?t=1773858958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Relaxed Exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover <strong>ultra-rare alleles</strong> across <strong>eight rarity levels</strong> in your bred rabbits, and learn more about the <strong>real principles of inheritance</strong> through the in-game book.<br>With the <strong>\u201c1 month = 1 game round\u201d</strong> system, you decide how much time you want to spend with your rabbits each month.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to <strong>breed the rarest rabbits</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966790/extras/d18dec0112f5cc32c419cf6c39325e99.poster.avif?t=1773858958\" width=1024 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966790/extras/d18dec0112f5cc32c419cf6c39325e99.webm?t=1773858958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966790/extras/d18dec0112f5cc32c419cf6c39325e99.mp4?t=1773858958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["THOMIC"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966790/2099336ebbb87e5969c91b7f1fec2b2251c2da19/header.jpg?t=1773858958","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3966790/2133423470/334300b257065eb8bd967ac358b530557c23d688/1773856810/dash_av1.mpd?t=1773858956","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3966790/2133423470/334300b257065eb8bd967ac358b530557c23d688/1773856810/dash_h264.mpd?t=1773858956","highlight":t